    ('〜なくて','A て form of the negative ない, which indicates a cause/reason for a state or action.','A て form of the negative ない, which indicates a cause/reason for a state or action.'),
    ('〜なくなる','It has reached the point where some state or action does not take place anymore.','It has reached the point where some state or action does not take place anymore.'),
    ('〜なさい','A polite imperative used by superiors such as parents or teachers to their inferiors (=people of younger age and lower rank)','A polite imperative used by superiors such as parents or teachers to their inferiors (=people of younger age and lower rank)'),
    ('〜なら','A conjunction which indicates that the preceding sentence is the speaker’s supposition about the truth of a present or past fact or the actualisation of something in the future.','A conjunction which indicates that the preceding sentence is the speaker’s supposition about the truth of a present or past fact or the actualisation of something in the future.'),
    ('〜にする','Someone has decided on something.','Someone has decided on something.'),
    ('〜ので','A subordinate conjunction which expresses a reason or a cause.','A subordinate conjunction which expresses a reason or a cause.'),
    ('〜ば','A conjunction which indicates that the preceding clause expresses a conditional.','A conjunction which indicates that the preceding clause expresses a conditional.'),
    ('〜はず','A dependant noun which expresses the speaker’s expectation that something will take place or took place or that someone/something is or was in some state.','A dependant noun which expresses the speaker’s expectation that something will take place or took place or that someone/something is or was in some state.'),
    ('〜ばよかった','A phrase which expresses the speaker’s regret.','A phrase which expresses the speaker’s regret.'),
    ('〜まで','A particle to indicate a spatial, temporal or quantitative limit or an unexpected animate/inanimate object.','A particle to indicate a spatial, temporal or quantitative limit or an unexpected animate/inanimate object.'),
    ('〜までに','A particle that indicates a time limit on/for an action.','A particle that indicates a time limit on/for an action.'),
    ('〜ようだ','An auxiliary な type adjective which expresses the likelihood of something/someone or the likeness of something/someone to something/someone.','An auxiliary な type adjective which expresses the likelihood of something/someone or the likeness of something/someone to something/someone.'),
    ('〜ようと思う','The speaker desires or decides to do something.','The speaker desires or decides to do something.'),
    ('〜ようにする','Someone causes some circumstantial or behavioural change to take place.','Someone causes some circumstantial or behavioural change to take place.'),
    ('〜ようになる','Some change takes place gradually.','Some change takes place gradually.'),
    ('〜らしい','An auxiliary adjective which indicates that the preceding sentence is the speaker’s conjecture based on what he has heard, read or seen.','An auxiliary adjective which indicates that the preceding sentence is the speaker’s conjecture based on what he has heard, read or seen.'),
    ('〜わけではない','A phrase which is used to deny what is implied in the previous or following statement.','A phrase which is used to deny what is implied in the previous or following statement.'),
    ('〜が〜なら','A structure presenting a counterfactual situation which indicates that things would be better if something were really good or appropriate.','A structure presenting a counterfactual situation which indicates that things would be better if something were really good or appropriate.'),
    ('〜ても〜ても','A structure meaning “even if someone does something repeatedly”.','A structure meaning “even if someone does something repeatedly”.'),
    ('〜といい〜といい','A structure that introduces multiple perspectives when describing a person or a thing.','A structure that introduces multiple perspectives when describing a person or a thing.'),
    ('〜もVば〜もV','A structure used to present typical examples of actions, events, situations, people, or things among a number of possibilities.','A structure used to present typical examples of actions, events, situations, people, or things among a number of possibilities.'),
    ('あげる','Someone gives something to a person who is not a member of the giver’s in group but whose status is about equal to that of the giver.','Someone gives something to a person who is not a member of the giver’s in group but whose status is about equal to that of the giver.'),
    ('〜てあげる','Someone gives some action as a favour to a person who is not a member of the giver’s in group but whose status is about equal of the giver.','Someone gives some action as a favour to a person who is not a member of the giver’s in group but whose status is about equal of the giver.'),
    ('お〜になる','A phrase which expresses the speaker’s respect for someone when describing that person’s action or state','A phrase which expresses the speaker’s respect for someone when describing that person’s action or state'),
    ('〜ことができる','Doing something is possible','Doing something is possible'),
    ('〜のに','Contrary to everybody’s expectation based on the sentence preceding [x], the proposition in the sentence following [x] is the case.','Contrary to everybody’s expectation based on the sentence preceding [x], the proposition in the sentence following [x] is the case.'),
    ('〜のに（目的）','In the process or for the purpose of doing something expressed in the の nominalised clause.','In the process or for the purpose of doing something expressed in the の nominalised clause.'),
    ('もらう','The first person or someone the speaker empathises with receives something from someone whose status is not as high as the receiver’s.','The first person or someone the speaker empathises with receives something from someone whose status is not as high as the receiver’s.'),
    ('〜てもらう','The first person or someone the speaker empathizes with receives some benefit from an action by someone whose status is not as high as the receiver’s.','The first person or someone the speaker empathizes with receives some benefit from an action by someone whose status is not as high as the receiver’s.'),
    ('〜出す','Something that has been latent is realised.','Something that has been latent is realised.'),
    ('〜前に','In front of or before some situation comes about.','In front of or before some situation comes about.'),
    ('くれる','Someone whose status is not higher than the speaker’s gives something to the first person or to someone with whom the speaker empathises.','Someone whose status is not higher than the speaker’s gives something to the first person or to someone with whom the speaker empathises.'),
    ('〜てくれる','Someone does something as a favour to the first person or to someone with whom the speaker empathises.','Someone does something as a favour to the first person or to someone with whom the speaker empathises.'),
    ('〜始める','Someone/something begins to do something or begins to be in some state.','Someone/something begins to do something or begins to be in some state.'),
    ('〜方','A noun forming suffix that indicates a way or a manner in which one does something.','A noun forming suffix that indicates a way or a manner in which one does something.'),
    ('〜やすい','Something or someone is easy to ~.','Something or someone is easy to ~.'),
    ('〜時','A dependent noun which indicates the time when someone/something will do/does/did something or the time when someone/something will be/is/was in some state.','A dependent noun which indicates the time when someone/something will do/does/did something or the time when someone/something will be/is/was in some state.'),
    ('来る','Someone or something moves in a direction towards the speaker or the speaker’s viewpoint or area of empathy.','Someone or something moves in a direction towards the speaker or the speaker’s viewpoint or area of empathy.'),
    ('〜てくる','An auxiliary verb which indicates the beginning of some process or continuation of some action up to a current point of time.','An auxiliary verb which indicates the beginning of some process or continuation of some action up to a current point of time.'),
    ('欲しい','Something is desired by the speaker.','Something is desired by the speaker.'),
    ('〜て欲しい','Want someone (who is not higher in status than the speaker) to do something.','Want someone (who is not higher in status than the speaker) to do something.'),
    ('為（に）・ため（に）','A noun that indicates a benefit, a purpose, a reason or a cause.','A noun that indicates a benefit, a purpose, a reason or a cause.'),
    ('〜終わる','Finish doing ~','Finish doing ~'),
    ('行く','Someone or something moves in a direction away from the speaker or the speaker’s viewpoint.','Someone or something moves in a direction away from the speaker or the speaker’s viewpoint.'),
    ('〜ていく','Some action or state keeps changing from the point in time at which the speaker first describes the action.','Some action or state keeps changing from the point in time at which the speaker first describes the action.'),
    ('〜すぎる','Someone/something does something excessively or is in a state excessively.','Someone/something does something excessively or is in a state excessively.'),
    ('〜にくい','Something or someone is hard to ~.','Something or someone is hard to ~.'),
    ('〜ながら（も）（逆接）','A disjunctive conjunction used normally in written Japanese with the meaning of ''although''.','A disjunctive conjunction used normally in written Japanese with the meaning of ''although''.'),
    ('〜も〜ば','A structure which expresses the idea that a certain amount of something is sufficient to do something.','A structure which expresses the idea that a certain amount of something is sufficient to do something.'),
    ('（っ）きり','A conjunction indicating that since something occurred, nothing has happened and the resultant situation remains unchanged; a particle indicating a strict limitation in terms of number/quantity.','A conjunction indicating that since something occurred, nothing has happened and the resultant situation remains unchanged; a particle indicating a strict limitation in terms of number/quantity.'),
    ('〜（っ）たって（譲歩）','The informal form of ても.','The informal form of ても.'),
    ('〜（っ）たって（と言っても・としても）','The contracted form of と言っても or としても.','The contracted form of と言っても or としても.'),
    ('〜（と言）ったらない','A phrase used to express a strong sensation or emotion.','A phrase used to express a strong sensation or emotion.'),
    ('〜であれ〜であれ','A structure that means “no matter which one is the case”','A structure that means “no matter which one is the case”'),
    ('〜でも[Wh. word]でも','A structure indicating that what is expressed in the main/subordinate clause is applicable to anyone, anything, any place or any time.','A structure indicating that what is expressed in the main/subordinate clause is applicable to anyone, anything, any place or any time.'),
    ('〜に〜ない','A sentence structure meaning “someone cannot manage to do something”','A sentence structure meaning “someone cannot manage to do something”'),
    ('〜の〜のと','A structure that states what is said by someone in order to express the speaker’s disagreement or dissatisfaction.','A structure that states what is said by someone in order to express the speaker’s disagreement or dissatisfaction.'),
    ('〜やら〜やら','A structure to present things, events, actions, etc., as examples, reasons or possibilities.','A structure to present things, events, actions, etc., as examples, reasons or possibilities.'),
    ('〜わ〜わ','A structure that emphatically presents actions, events or states as examples or reasons, or indicates that someone does something or something happens to a great extent.','A structure that emphatically presents actions, events or states as examples or reasons, or indicates that someone does something or something happens to a great extent.'),
    ('〜言わず〜と言わず','A structure indicating that something is the case not only for A and B but also for many other places, things, etc., of X, to which A and B belong','A structure indicating that something is the case not only for A and B but also for many other places, things, etc., of X, to which A and B belong'),
    ('あえて','An adverb that expresses the speaker''s/writer''s desire or will to dare to do something in spite of difficulty, danger or opposition.','An adverb that expresses the speaker''s/writer''s desire or will to dare to do something in spite of difficulty, danger or opposition.'),
    ('あくまでも','An adverb that represents the idea of "to the utmost degree".','An adverb that represents the idea of "to the utmost degree".'),
