    ('それだけ','An adverbial phrase indicating that the degree of something is proportionate to the degree of the state, action or event mentioned in the preceding sentence.','An adverbial phrase indicating that the degree of something is proportionate to the degree of the state, action or event mentioned in the preceding sentence.'),
    ('〜それなりに・の','A phrase representing the idea that someone/something does something or is in a state in his/her/its own way, or in a way suitable to the situation or generally expected from the situation.','A phrase representing the idea that someone/something does something or is in a state in his/her/its own way, or in a way suitable to the situation or generally expected from the situation.'),
    ('たかが','A noun modiﬁer used when the speaker thinks little of the referent of the modiﬁed noun or noun phrase.','A noun modiﬁer used when the speaker thinks little of the referent of the modiﬁed noun or noun phrase.'),
