    ('〜だに','A particle indicating that something expressed by the preceding verb alone produces a certain feeling or the meaning “(not) even doing something; doesn’t even occur”.','A particle indicating that something expressed by the preceding verb alone produces a certain feeling or the meaning “(not) even doing something; doesn’t even occur”.'),
    ('だの','A conjunction that lists nouns/quotes inexhaustively.','A conjunction that lists nouns/quotes inexhaustively.'),
