    ('〜とは','A compound particle marking an event, action or state that the speaker/writer does not expect and that causes him/her to feel some emotion','A compound particle marking an event, action or state that the speaker/writer does not expect and that causes him/her to feel some emotion'),
    ('〜とばかりに','A phrase that indicates that someone does something in order to convey something or in such a way that someone is convinced that something is the case.','A phrase that indicates that someone does something in order to convey something or in such a way that someone is convinced that something is the case.'),
