    ('なお','An adverb that indicates that an action or state is still going on or the degree of something increases; a conjunction indicating that an additional comment follows what has just been said in the preceding sentence.','An adverb that indicates that an action or state is still going on or the degree of something increases; a conjunction indicating that an additional comment follows what has just been said in the preceding sentence.'),
    ('なおさら','An adverb indicating that the degree of something increases due to an additional circumstance.','An adverb indicating that the degree of something increases due to an additional circumstance.'),
    ('〜なくして（は）','A compound particle meaning “without something”.','A compound particle meaning “without something”.'),
    ('なしに','An adverbial phrase meaning “without (doing) something”.','An adverbial phrase meaning “without (doing) something”.'),
    ('なす','A verb that means “to cause something to happen”','A verb that means “to cause something to happen”'),
    ('なぜか','An adverb indicating that the speaker/writer doesn’t know the cause of/reason for something','An adverb indicating that the speaker/writer doesn’t know the cause of/reason for something'),
    ('〜なぜなら（ば）〜からだ','A structure used to introduce a reason for the statement in the preceding sentence.','A structure used to introduce a reason for the statement in the preceding sentence.'),
    ('なまじ（っか）','An adverb indicating that something (including an action/state) has a positive value which hasn’t been reached, causing something negative.','An adverb indicating that something (including an action/state) has a positive value which hasn’t been reached, causing something negative.'),
    ('〜ならでは（の）','A phrase indicating something is “impossible if it’s not X”.','A phrase indicating something is “impossible if it’s not X”.'),
