    ('〜にしたところで','A compound particle that means “even” or “also”.','A compound particle that means “even” or “also”.'),
    ('〜にして（時点・段階）','A compound particle that indicates a period of time/stage (in life) at which some surprising action or state takes place.','A compound particle that indicates a period of time/stage (in life) at which some surprising action or state takes place.'),
    ('〜にして（並列）','A conjunction meaning “and” that is used to combine two noun phrases or な-adjectives.','A conjunction meaning “and” that is used to combine two noun phrases or な-adjectives.'),
    ('〜にしてからが','A compound particle indicating that something unexpected occurs.','A compound particle indicating that something unexpected occurs.'),
    ('にしても','A conjunction that represents the idea of “even if someone decides to do something,” or “even if/though someone decides that something is true/the case”.','A conjunction that represents the idea of “even if someone decides to do something,” or “even if/though someone decides that something is true/the case”.'),
    ('〜にしろ・せよ','A conjunctive phrase that carries the meaning of concession.','A conjunctive phrase that carries the meaning of concession.'),
    ('につけ','A conjunction indicating that each time someone perceives something he/she feels or thinks something associated with it.','A conjunction indicating that each time someone perceives something he/she feels or thinks something associated with it.'),
    ('〜にとどまらず','A phrase indicating that something goes beyond a spatial/temporal boundary.','A phrase indicating that something goes beyond a spatial/temporal boundary.'),
    ('〜にひきかえ','A phrase that indicates a sharp contrast.','A phrase that indicates a sharp contrast.'),
    ('〜によらず','A compound particle that means “without depending on”.','A compound particle that means “without depending on”.'),
    ('〜によると','A compound particle that is used to identify the source of information provided in the sentence.','A compound particle that is used to identify the source of information provided in the sentence.'),
    ('〜にわたって・わたる','A compound particle indicating that something takes place over a particular span of time or physical space.','A compound particle indicating that something takes place over a particular span of time or physical space.'),
    ('〜に向けて・に向けた','A compound particle that indicates the destination/direction of movement, the target/direction of an action, or the goal/purpose of an action.','A compound particle that indicates the destination/direction of movement, the target/direction of an action, or the goal/purpose of an action.'),
    ('〜に応じて・応じた','A compound particle that means “in response to”.','A compound particle that means “in response to”.'),
    ('〜に決まっている','A phrase indicating the speaker’s/writer’s strong conviction or motivation.','A phrase indicating the speaker’s/writer’s strong conviction or motivation.'),
    ('〜に越したことはない','A phrase used to indicate that a state or action is more desirable.','A phrase used to indicate that a state or action is more desirable.'),
    ('〜のなんのって','A phrase to emphasize that something/someone is/was in an extreme state or that someone does/did something to a great extent','A phrase to emphasize that something/someone is/was in an extreme state or that someone does/did something to a great extent'),
    ('〜のみならず','A phrase that is used in formal writing to mean “not only”.','A phrase that is used in formal writing to mean “not only”.'),
    ('〜の無さ','A phrase that indicates a state where something is lacking.','A phrase that indicates a state where something is lacking.'),
    ('〜はあれ','A phrase expressing the idea “even though there is something”','A phrase expressing the idea “even though there is something”'),
    ('〜はいいとしても','A phrase that conveys the meaning “even if I/we accept something, something else is not acceptable”.','A phrase that conveys the meaning “even if I/we accept something, something else is not acceptable”.'),
    ('〜はおろか','A phrase that is used when something is not only true with one thing or person, but also with another thing or person that is less expected or understandable.','A phrase that is used when something is not only true with one thing or person, but also with another thing or person that is less expected or understandable.'),
    ('ばかりに','A conjunction indicating that a single factor causes a negative situation.','A conjunction indicating that a single factor causes a negative situation.'),
    ('ばこそ','A conjunction that emphasizes a reason','A conjunction that emphasizes a reason'),
    ('はたして','An adverb indicating that something occurred as the writer expected, or expressing in a concession clause the writer’s strong doubt.','An adverb indicating that something occurred as the writer expected, or expressing in a concession clause the writer’s strong doubt.'),
    ('〜は別として','A phrase used to present an exception or an issue the speaker/writer does not intend to cover as part of a larger statement.','A phrase used to present an exception or an issue the speaker/writer does not intend to cover as part of a larger statement.'),
    ('ひいては','An adverb indicating that something is perceived to eventually lead to a signiﬁcant result.','An adverb indicating that something is perceived to eventually lead to a signiﬁcant result.'),
    ('ひとつ','An adverb used when the speaker intends to do something, or asks someone a favour, or makes a suggestion or gives advice to someone.','An adverb used when the speaker intends to do something, or asks someone a favour, or makes a suggestion or gives advice to someone.'),
    ('〜べからず・べからざる','An auxiliary verb that indicates a strong prohibition.','An auxiliary verb that indicates a strong prohibition.'),
    ('べく','The verb modification form of the auxiliary bekida, which is used to indicate a purpose or aim.','The verb modification form of the auxiliary bekida, which is used to indicate a purpose or aim.'),
    ('〜べくして','A phrase used when something occurs/occured exactly as expected','A phrase used when something occurs/occured exactly as expected'),
    ('〜べくもない','A phrase meaning “it is impossible to do something”','A phrase meaning “it is impossible to do something”'),
    ('まして（や）','An adverb expressing the idea that because one statement is true, the subsequent statement is naturally true.','An adverb expressing the idea that because one statement is true, the subsequent statement is naturally true.'),
    ('また','An adverb/conjunction that indicates repetition or addition.','An adverb/conjunction that indicates repetition or addition.'),
    ('〜まで（のこと）だ','A phrase indicating someone’s decision to cope with a negative situation, or a simple, straight forward reason for his/her action.','A phrase indicating someone’s decision to cope with a negative situation, or a simple, straight forward reason for his/her action.'),
    ('むしろ','An adverb that indicates one of two things/people/characteristics has been chosen rather than the other to express speaker’s/writer’s desire, preference or judgment.','An adverb that indicates one of two things/people/characteristics has been chosen rather than the other to express speaker’s/writer’s desire, preference or judgment.'),
    ('〜もさることながら','A phrase used to mention something important and then introduce something more signiﬁcant.','A phrase used to mention something important and then introduce something more signiﬁcant.'),
    ('もしくは','A conjunction to disjunctively connect two items or ideas.','A conjunction to disjunctively connect two items or ideas.'),
    ('もっとも','A conjunction used to add a comment indicating that what the speaker/writer has just expressed is not sufﬁcient.','A conjunction used to add a comment indicating that what the speaker/writer has just expressed is not sufﬁcient.'),
    ('〜ものか（反語）','A rhetorical question marker that expresses a strong negative intention or disagreement.','A rhetorical question marker that expresses a strong negative intention or disagreement.'),
    ('〜ものか（選択・自問）','A phrase indicating that the speaker wants to do something or is wondering what one he/she should choose.','A phrase indicating that the speaker wants to do something or is wondering what one he/she should choose.'),
    ('ものではない','A sentence-ﬁnal phrase indicating that one shouldn’t do something, one could not possibly do something, or one naturally cannot do something.','A sentence-ﬁnal phrase indicating that one shouldn’t do something, one could not possibly do something, or one naturally cannot do something.'),
    ('ものなら','A conjunction indicating that the preceding clause presents a hypothetical situation that is unlikely to become a reality.','A conjunction indicating that the preceding clause presents a hypothetical situation that is unlikely to become a reality.'),
    ('ものの','A conjunction that means “although”.','A conjunction that means “although”.'),
    ('ものを','A disjunctive coordinate conjunction expressing the meaning of “although” with the speaker’s strong feeling of discontent','A disjunctive coordinate conjunction expressing the meaning of “although” with the speaker’s strong feeling of discontent'),
    ('やら','A sentence-ﬁnal particle that marks a self-addressed question.','A sentence-ﬁnal particle that marks a self-addressed question.'),
    ('や否や','A conjunction that expresses the idea that something happened or someone did something immediately following another event or action.','A conjunction that expresses the idea that something happened or someone did something immediately following another event or action.'),
    ('ようでは','A conjunction that presents an undesirable situation, which is assumed to be factual.','A conjunction that presents an undesirable situation, which is assumed to be factual.'),
    ('〜ようと・が','A conjunctive phrase that expresses the idea of concession.','A conjunctive phrase that expresses the idea of concession.'),
    ('〜ようにも（〜ない）','A conjunctive phrase that indicates concession: “even though someone tries to do something, he/she cannot do it for some reason”.','A conjunctive phrase that indicates concession: “even though someone tries to do something, he/she cannot do it for some reason”.'),
    ('〜ようものなら','A conjunctive phrase that presents an undesirable hypothetical situation.','A conjunctive phrase that presents an undesirable hypothetical situation.'),
    ('〜より・のほか（に）（は）〜ない','A phrase that conveys the idea that there is no other choice than to do something, or that something is true of only one of a select few things.','A phrase that conveys the idea that there is no other choice than to do something, or that something is true of only one of a select few things.'),
    ('〜をおいてほかに（は）〜ない','A phrase that means “there is nothing else besides X”.','A phrase that means “there is nothing else besides X”.'),
    ('〜をめぐって・めぐる','A compound particle meaning “concerning; over”, which is used with an issue over which different opinions, ideas, etc., are expressed or exchanged.','A compound particle meaning “concerning; over”, which is used with an issue over which different opinions, ideas, etc., are expressed or exchanged.'),
    ('〜をものともせず','A phrase indicating that someone does something bravely/fearlessly in spite of unfavourable circumstances.','A phrase indicating that someone does something bravely/fearlessly in spite of unfavourable circumstances.'),
    ('〜をよそに','A compound particle that expresses someone’s indifference to warnings, criticism, advice, accusations, opposition, anxiety, wishes, eagerness, provocative actions, etc.','A compound particle that expresses someone’s indifference to warnings, criticism, advice, accusations, opposition, anxiety, wishes, eagerness, provocative actions, etc.'),
    ('〜を中心に','A phrase that means “with something/someone at the centre”.','A phrase that means “with something/someone at the centre”.'),
    ('〜を介して/介した','A compound particle that introduces a medium through which someone does something or something happens to someone or something.','A compound particle that introduces a medium through which someone does something or something happens to someone or something.'),
    ('〜を問わず','A compound particle that means “without questioning”.','A compound particle that means “without questioning”.'),
    ('〜を禁じ得ない','A phrase that is used when one cannot control emotions or reactions caused by emotions.','A phrase that is used when one cannot control emotions or reactions caused by emotions.'),
    ('〜んとする','A phrase meaning for “someone to try to do something” or for “something to be about to occur”.','A phrase meaning for “someone to try to do something” or for “something to be about to occur”.'),
    ('んばかり（に）','An adverbial phrase that is used when a situation looks as if someone were about to do something or as if something were about to occur literally or ﬁguratively.','An adverbial phrase that is used when a situation looks as if someone were about to do something or as if something were about to occur literally or ﬁguratively.'),
    ('〜一[Counter]として〜ない','A structure that means “not a single one".','A structure that means “not a single one".'),
    ('一つには','An adverb meaning “partly” in a context where someone gives one or two objectives, benefits, examples or reasons for something.','An adverb meaning “partly” in a context where someone gives one or two objectives, benefits, examples or reasons for something.'),
    ('〜一切〜ない','A structure that means “not at all”.','A structure that means “not at all”.'),
    ('一応','An adverb indicating that an action or state is only temporary or tentative or is superﬁcially conceived.','An adverb indicating that an action or state is only temporary or tentative or is superﬁcially conceived.'),
    ('〜一方（だ）','A phrase indicating that “something happens continuously” or “someone does something repeatedly”.','A phrase indicating that “something happens continuously” or “someone does something repeatedly”.'),
    ('一方（で）','A conjunction used to present two concurrent actions/events/states or contrastive situations.','A conjunction used to present two concurrent actions/events/states or contrastive situations.'),
    ('一旦','An adverb meaning “once” or “for a short time”.','An adverb meaning “once” or “for a short time”.'),
    ('且つ','A conjunction meaning “and” that connects words, phrases and sentences.','A conjunction meaning “and” that connects words, phrases and sentences.'),
    ('並びに','A conjunction used to combine two nouns or noun phrases.','A conjunction used to combine two nouns or noun phrases.'),
    ('並み','A noun sufﬁx that adds the meaning “to match”.','A noun sufﬁx that adds the meaning “to match”.'),
    ('〜中を','A phrase that specifies space or time in/through which someone/something does something.','A phrase that specifies space or time in/through which someone/something does something.'),
    ('今更','An adverb indicating that someone feels that it is too late to do something.','An adverb indicating that someone feels that it is too late to do something.'),
    ('以来','An adverb meaning “since”','An adverb meaning “since”'),
