    ('但し','A conjunction indicating that there is a condition, restriction, proviso, etc., to the preceding statement.','A conjunction indicating that there is a condition, restriction, proviso, etc., to the preceding statement.'),
    ('〜何[(Number)+Counter]も','A phrase that indicates there is a large number of things, people, etc.','A phrase that indicates there is a large number of things, people, etc.'),
    ('〜何〜ない','A structure indicating that something doesn''t exist at all.','A structure indicating that something doesn''t exist at all.'),
    ('何とか','An adverb expressing that someone somehow does something, or something somehow occurs.','An adverb expressing that someone somehow does something, or something somehow occurs.'),
    ('〜何も〜ない','A structure indicating that an action is taken for no good reason.','A structure indicating that an action is taken for no good reason.'),
    ('〜何ら〜ない','A structure that is used to express a strong negative statement.','A structure that is used to express a strong negative statement.'),
    ('〜何らかの','A phrase used to indicate that the exact nature of something represented by the noun cannot be speciﬁed.','A phrase used to indicate that the exact nature of something represented by the noun cannot be speciﬁed.'),
    ('〜割に（は）','A phrase that expresses the idea that something is not in proportion to what one would normally expect.','A phrase that expresses the idea that something is not in proportion to what one would normally expect.'),
    ('加えて','A conjunction that means “in addition to what has just been mentioned”.','A conjunction that means “in addition to what has just been mentioned”.'),
    ('単に','An adverb that means “simply”','An adverb that means “simply”'),
    ('〜単位で','A phrase that indicates the smallest amount, number or unit of something (or people) involved.','A phrase that indicates the smallest amount, number or unit of something (or people) involved.'),
    ('〜及び','A particle that connects two nouns or noun phrases.','A particle that connects two nouns or noun phrases.'),
    ('反面','A conjunction used to contrast the positive and negative sides of something/someone.','A conjunction used to contrast the positive and negative sides of something/someone.'),
    ('同士','A sufﬁx that adds the meaning of “the same things/people”.','A sufﬁx that adds the meaning of “the same things/people”.'),
    ('〜向け','A suffix that adds the meaning of “aimed at”','A suffix that adds the meaning of “aimed at”'),
    ('如何（だ）・いかん（だ）','A classic form of the adverb どのように “in what way”.','A classic form of the adverb どのように “in what way”.'),
    ('〜思うに','A phrase indicating that the subsequent statement is the speaker’s/writer’s personal view.','A phrase indicating that the subsequent statement is the speaker’s/writer’s personal view.'),
    ('思えば','An adverb that indicates feelings of nostalgia or regret when recollecting one’s past experiences.','An adverb that indicates feelings of nostalgia or regret when recollecting one’s past experiences.'),
    ('〜恐れがある','A phrase that means “it is feared (that)"','A phrase that means “it is feared (that)"'),
    ('折(に)','A noun indicating special/uncommon and primarily desirable occasions which someone takes advantage of, or where someone is expected to do something or where something desirable takes place.','A noun indicating special/uncommon and primarily desirable occasions which someone takes advantage of, or where someone is expected to do something or where something desirable takes place.'),
    ('故に','A conjunction that presents a reason or a cause.','A conjunction that presents a reason or a cause.'),
    ('更に','An adverb/conjunction that represents the idea of “additionally” or “further”.','An adverb/conjunction that represents the idea of “additionally” or “further”.'),
    ('末（に）','A noun that indicates the end of a period or the time after long, hard mental or physical work.','A noun that indicates the end of a period or the time after long, hard mental or physical work.'),
    ('済む','A verb that means “to be finished; to do (in the sense of being enough)”.','A verb that means “to be finished; to do (in the sense of being enough)”.'),
    ('〜滅多に〜ない','A structure that indicates extremely low frequency.','A structure that indicates extremely low frequency.'),
    ('由','A dependent noun that marks the content of what the writer has learned.','A dependent noun that marks the content of what the writer has learned.'),
    ('甲斐・かい・がい','A dependent noun that means something is worth someone’s effort.','A dependent noun that means something is worth someone’s effort.'),
    ('自体','A dependent noun that is used to emphasize the referent of the preceding noun.','A dependent noun that is used to emphasize the referent of the preceding noun.'),
    ('〜見るからに','A phrase indicating that something can be (obviously) recognized through visual cues.','A phrase indicating that something can be (obviously) recognized through visual cues.'),
    ('〜言うまでもない','A phrase indicating that what the speaker/writer expresses is generally known but that he/she presents it as a reminder.','A phrase indicating that what the speaker/writer expresses is generally known but that he/she presents it as a reminder.'),
    ('〜言ってみれば','A phrase signalling a comparison (including the use of simile and metaphor), a deﬁnition, or an explanation.','A phrase signalling a comparison (including the use of simile and metaphor), a deﬁnition, or an explanation.'),
    ('言わば','An adverb that means “if I were to say it some way (or a different way)”.','An adverb that means “if I were to say it some way (or a different way)”.'),
    ('〜限りだ','A phrase that indicates the extreme degree of the speaker’s/writer’s emotion — happiness, sorrow, envy, shame or loneliness, among others','A phrase that indicates the extreme degree of the speaker’s/writer’s emotion — happiness, sorrow, envy, shame or loneliness, among others'),
    ('願う・願います','A verb that expresses a polite request.','A verb that expresses a polite request.'),
    ('名詞修飾節','Reference-backed canonical grammar entry for 名詞修飾節.','Reference-backed canonical grammar entry for 名詞修飾節.'),
    ('あとで','Some state or action takes place at a time (not always immediately) after another state or action has taken place.','Some state or action takes place at a time (not always immediately) after another state or action has taken place.'),
    ('あまり（程度が低い）','The degree of something is not great.','The degree of something is not great.'),
    ('ある（存在）','An inanimate thing exists.','An inanimate thing exists.'),
    ('〜てある','Something has been done to something and the resultant state of that action remains.','Something has been done to something and the resultant state of that action remains.'),
    ('いる（存在）','An animate thing exists.','An animate thing exists.'),
    ('〜ている','Someone or something is doing something he or it started some time ago, or is in a state created by an action he or it took some time ago.','Someone or something is doing something he or it started some time ago, or is in a state created by an action he or it took some time ago.'),
    ('うちに','During a period when a certain situation remains in effect.','During a period when a certain situation remains in effect.'),
    ('お','A prefix that expresses politeness.','A prefix that expresses politeness.'),
    ('〜お〜する','A phrase which humbly expresses the speaker’s politeness to someone when describing the speaker’s action or state that involves or affects that person.','A phrase which humbly expresses the speaker’s politeness to someone when describing the speaker’s action or state that involves or affects that person.'),
    ('おく','Do something in advance for future convenience.','Do something in advance for future convenience.'),
    ('〜か（選択）','A particle which marks an alternative.','A particle which marks an alternative.'),
    ('〜が（主語）','A particle which indicates the subject.','A particle which indicates the subject.'),
    ('〜か（疑問）','A sentence final particle which indicates that the preceding sentence is interrogative.','A sentence final particle which indicates that the preceding sentence is interrogative.'),
    ('〜が（逆接）','A disjunctive coordinate conjunction that combines two sentences.','A disjunctive coordinate conjunction that combines two sentences.'),
    ('〜か（埋め込み疑問）','A marker for an embedded yes-no question.','A marker for an embedded yes-no question.'),
    ('〜かい','A sentence final particle which marks yes-no questions in informal male speech.','A sentence final particle which marks yes-no questions in informal male speech.'),
    ('〜かしら','A sentence final particle which expresses the idea that the female speaker wonders about something.','A sentence final particle which expresses the idea that the female speaker wonders about something.'),
    ('〜から（起点・出所）','A particle which indicates a starting point or a source.','A particle which indicates a starting point or a source.'),
    ('〜から（時間起点）','After/since a point in time at which something takes place.','After/since a point in time at which something takes place.'),
    ('〜から（理由）','A subordinate conjunction which expresses a reason or a cause.','A subordinate conjunction which expresses a reason or a cause.'),
    ('けれども','A disjunctive subordinate conjunction that combines two sentences.','A disjunctive subordinate conjunction that combines two sentences.'),
    ('こと（形式名詞・事柄）','A thing which is intangible.','A thing which is intangible.'),
    ('〜こと（名詞化）','A nominaliser used to indicate the speaker’s relative lack of empathy with the content of the sentence he is nominalising.','A nominaliser used to indicate the speaker’s relative lack of empathy with the content of the sentence he is nominalising.'),
    ('〜たことがある','There was a time when ~','There was a time when ~'),
    ('〜ことがある（時々）','There are times when ~.','There are times when ~.'),
    ('ごとに','Something takes place regularly in succession after a certain temporal or spatial interval.','Something takes place regularly in succession after a certain temporal or spatial interval.'),
    ('ことは','Speaking of proposition X, X is certainly true.','Speaking of proposition X, X is certainly true.'),
    ('〜さ（名詞化）','A suffix that makes a noun out of an adjective by attaching it to the stem of an Adj (い) or much less frequently to the stem of an Adj (な)','A suffix that makes a noun out of an adjective by attaching it to the stem of an Adj (い) or much less frequently to the stem of an Adj (な)'),
    ('させる','Cause someone/something to do something or cause something to change its state.','Cause someone/something to do something or cause something to change its state.'),
    ('しい','An infix attached to the stem of an adjective い to indicate something that one cannot objectively measure on any scale (e.g. human emotion).','An infix attached to the stem of an adjective い to indicate something that one cannot objectively measure on any scale (e.g. human emotion).'),
    ('〜しか','A particle which marks an element X when nothing but X makes the expressed proposition true.','A particle which marks an element X when nothing but X makes the expressed proposition true.'),
    ('〜しまう','An auxiliary verb which indicates the completion of an action.','An auxiliary verb which indicates the completion of an action.'),
    ('〜ずつ','A particle that indicates equal distribution of quantity.','A particle that indicates equal distribution of quantity.'),
    ('〜くする／〜にする（変化）','Someone/something causes a state or action to take place.','Someone/something causes a state or action to take place.'),
    ('する（属性）','Someone or something has some (semi)permanent attribute.','Someone or something has some (semi)permanent attribute.'),
    ('〜がする（感覚）','Something is perceived by someone’s non-visual senses.','Something is perceived by someone’s non-visual senses.'),
    ('する（値段・時間）','A verb that indicates how much something costs or a duration of time.','A verb that indicates how much something costs or a duration of time.'),
    ('すると','A coordinate conjunction which connects two sentences (the second sentence either describes an event which takes place right after the event described in the first sentence or it expresses a logical guess related to the event in the first sentence.)','A coordinate conjunction which connects two sentences (the second sentence either describes an event which takes place right after the event described in the first sentence or it expresses a logical guess related to the event in the first sentence.)'),
    ('せっかく','Some situation which seldom occurs has now occurred and one can either make use of it or, to one’s regret, cannot make use of it.','Some situation which seldom occurs has now occurred and one can either make use of it or, to one’s regret, cannot make use of it.'),
    ('〜そうだ（伝聞）','An auxiliary which indicates that the information expressed by the preceding sentence is what the speaker heard.','An auxiliary which indicates that the information expressed by the preceding sentence is what the speaker heard.'),
    ('〜そうだ（様態）','An auxiliary adjective which indicates that what is expressed by the preceding sentence is the speaker’s conjecture concerning an event in the future or the present state of someone or something, based on what the speaker sees or feels.','An auxiliary adjective which indicates that what is expressed by the preceding sentence is the speaker’s conjecture concerning an event in the future or the present state of someone or something, based on what the speaker sees or feels.'),
