    ('〜そうかと言って','A structure which expresses that the speaker/writer cannot easily accept the corollary from the preceding statement owing to some circumstances, although he feels like accepting it','A structure which expresses that the speaker/writer cannot easily accept the corollary from the preceding statement owing to some circumstances, although he feels like accepting it'),
    ('〜そうになる','A phrase expressing that something almost happens.','A phrase expressing that something almost happens.'),
